cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "이 데이터셋을 사용하면 아래 정보를 인용해 주세요."
title: "Korean Elementary Learning Map"
abstract: >-
  A Korea-first graph of elementary learning aligned to the Korean 2022
  Revised National Curriculum, containing 11 curricula, 620 achievement-standard
  anchors, 1,956 micro-topics, 1,894 prerequisite dependencies, and 153 clusters.
  The Korean dataset and its tooling were independently built, inspired by
  Marble's learning-graph approach; this is not a translation, an official
  derivative of Marble, or an official MOE/NCIC publication.
type: dataset
version: "0.4.0"
